1. Scope
All copyrightable files and materials published in this GitHub repository,
regardless of format, directory, source, or purpose, including but not
limited to textbooks, other books, e-books, PDFs, scanned documents, notes,
written works, images, datasets, and source code, are made available under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).

2. Copyright and authorization
The project owner declares that the materials published in this repository
are either subject to rights held by the project owner or have been included
with the necessary authorization from the relevant rights holders to make
them available to the public under CC BY 4.0, including authorization for
reproduction, redistribution, adaptation, translation, and commercial use.
The respective authors and rights holders retain their copyrights.
No ownership of third-party copyrights is claimed merely by hosting them.

3. Permissions
Subject to CC BY 4.0, everyone may, without payment or additional
permission, anywhere in the world:
  * Copy, download, share, republish, print, and redistribute the materials
    in whole or in part, in any medium or format;
  * Translate, modify, remix, transform, and build upon the materials,
    including publishing adapted material; and
  * Use the materials and adaptations for personal, educational, nonprofit,
    or commercial purposes, including commercial publication and sale.
These permissions are non-exclusive and are irrevocable while the license
terms are complied with.

4. Conditions
When sharing the materials, including in modified form, users must comply
with the attribution and other conditions of CC BY 4.0, including giving
appropriate credit to the creators and designated attribution parties,
retaining supplied copyright notices, linking to the license, indicating
changes, not implying endorsement, and not imposing additional legal or
technological restrictions on the original licensed material.

5. Disclaimer and limits
To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, the materials are
provided "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE", without additional warranties, and
subject to the limitations of liability in Section 5 of CC BY 4.0.
This notice creates no separate warranty, indemnity, or guarantee beyond
the terms of CC BY 4.0. Patent rights, trademark rights, privacy rights,
and any rights the licensor lacks authority to license are not granted.

The official CC BY 4.0 legal text reproduced below is the license that
governs this repository. The above notices explain its scope and intended
application and do not modify or replace the license terms.

